Vendored code from AbstentionBench

Upstream repository: https://github.com/facebookresearch/AbstentionBench
Upstream commit: e291841 (27 Aug 2025)
Paper: Kirichenko et al., 2025, "AbstentionBench", arXiv 2506.09038v1

The seven files in this folder (abstention_performance.csv, evaluation.py, evaluation_judge_prompts.py,
fast-subset-indices.json, inference.py, models.py, system_prompt.py) are byte-identical to the upstream recipe/, data/
and analysis/ folders at that commit. No local edits. The upstream main.py, configs and dataset classes are not
vendored.

