What this repository uses from here: evaluation_judge_prompts.py (the judge prompt
LLM_JUDGE_ABSTENTION_COCONOT_STYLE_PROMPT, read by withholding/score/abstention_judge.py load_template) and
abstention_performance.csv (the paper's released per-dataset results, read by
withholding/analysis/abstention_report.py paper_recall). The other files are kept for reference.

One character note: line 42 of evaluation_judge_prompts.py holds an en dash inside the published judge prompt. It stays,
because the judge must read the prompt byte for byte.
